flowchart TD
  A[Open SSH connection] --> B{Host supplied?}
  B -->|No| C[Enter and confirm host]
  B -->|Yes| D{Default username enabled?}
  C --> D
  D -->|No| M[Enter username manually]
  D -->|Yes| E{Username source}
  E -->|Headscale| F[Current profile login name before first @]
  E -->|root| G[Use root]
  E -->|Custom| H[Trim custom username]
  F --> I{Valid Linux username?}
  G --> I
  H --> I
  I -->|No| M
  I -->|Yes| J{Automatic connection enabled?}
  J -->|No| K[Prefill username and wait for Enter]
  J -->|Yes| L[Start one SSH connection]
  M -->|Valid input and Enter| L
  K -->|Valid input and Enter| L
  L --> N{Connection outcome}
  N -->|Connected| O[Interactive terminal]
  N -->|Failed| P[Show error and recovery controls]
  O -->|Disconnect or exit| Q[Disconnected]
  P --> R{User action}
  Q --> R
  R -->|Reconnect| L
  R -->|Change user| M
